2026-10-23T22:00:05.5297511Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5297951Z 
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5298129Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5298437Z 
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5298578Z Commands:
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5299162Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5300409Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5301809Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5303483Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5304835Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5306052Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5307201Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5308402Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5309676Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5310950Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5312189Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5313531Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5314586Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5315711Z   export              Export an administrator-allowlisted device fingerprint via the privileged helper
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5316790Z   unexport            Release an allowlisted export and request local driver reattachment
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5317734Z   attach              Import a remote bus ID through an allowlisted endpoint and Linux VHCI
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5318559Z   detach              Disconnect an authorized local VHCI port (0..255)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5319359Z   sessions            Read authoritative native kernel session state through the helper
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5320123Z   status              Query helper and kernel status
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5320800Z   help                Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5321288Z 
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5321415Z Options:
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5321941Z       --json               Emit machine-readable JSON to stdout; logs remain on stderr
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5337641Z       --socket <SOCKET>    Root-owned local helper socket [default: /run/rustusb/control.sock]
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5338738Z       --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Discovery timeout covering DNS, connect and response [default: 10]
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5339615Z       --log-json           Emit JSON tracing logs on stderr
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5340186Z   -h, --help               Print help
2026-10-23T22:00:05.5340654Z   -V, --version            Print version
